0..71 Comment "// Transport of a function along `ua`: the cubical case table of Cohen,"
72..141 Comment "// Coquand, Huber and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive"
142..216 Comment "// interpretation of the univalence axiom_ (TYPES 2015, arXiv:1611.02108),"
217..294 Comment "// § 4.5, read at a function type. The argument moves back along the path by"
295..367 Comment "// the record\'s left inverse, the function applies, and the result moves"
368..399 Comment "// forward by the record\'s map."
401..472 Comment "// The circle, the presented integers, the winding number and spinning."
